# Not part of the site: internal instructions for whoever works on this
# surface. assets.directory is this dir, so without this line the file is
# served at the surface's public URL.
CLAUDE.md

# Node test harnesses. Nothing the browser loads imports one — they exist to be
# run by `node` and by preflight — but assets.directory is this dir, so they
# were being uploaded and served at their public URLs (verified: /proteus/
# flagella.selftest.mjs returned 200). Gitignore syntax, so a bare pattern
# matches at any depth.
*.selftest.mjs

# The Rust source of the /pong/ lattice Boltzmann solver. The browser downloads
# the compiled pong/solver.wasm; nothing needs the crate, and assets.directory
# is this dir, so without this line every .rs file is served.
pong/solver/
